what you leave out.

552
00:19:40,604 --> 00:19:43,363
"83款经典车型"
"83 classic wagon."

553
00:19:43,394 --> 00:19:45,815
其实配件老难找了
Tough to find parts.

554
00:19:45,856 --> 00:19:49,024
"厂家以后都不生产了"
"They don't make them like this anymore."

555
00:19:50,015 --> 00:19:52,979
其实是有安全隐患
For legal reasons.

556
00:19:53,592 --> 00:19:57,577
"可供幸福大家庭享用多年"
"Enjoyed for many years by one happy family."

557
00:19:59,999 --> 00:20:01,808
浣熊它们家
Of raccoons.

558
00:20:04,413 --> 00:20:06,283
开玩笑的 其实
I'm kidding. Actually...

559
00:20:07,714 --> 00:20:10,289
其实它的确带给我们一段很长的快乐时光
Actually, it did make us happy for a long time.

560
00:20:10,289 --> 00:20:11,853
真的很难说再见
It's gonna be tough to say goodbye.

561
00:20:11,853 --> 00:20:13,590
世事皆如此
It always is.

562
00:20:13,641 --> 00:20:15,613
没人喜欢改变
Nobody loves change.

563
00:20:15,654 --> 00:20:17,902
但是
But...

564
00:20:17,933 --> 00:20:21,039
学会放手也是人生的一部分
Part of life is learning to let things go.

565
00:20:25,178 --> 00:20:27,518
我真以为自己要吐你身上了
I totally thought I was gonna puke on you.

566
00:20:27,548 --> 00:20:29,388
你真敢我就杀了你
I would have killed you if you did.

567
00:20:29,429 --> 00:20:30,890
是哦 就像你杀了那只蜘蛛一样
Oh, yeah, like you killed that spider?

568
00:20:30,931 --> 00:20:32,596
你又没看到 好大一只呢
Oh, you didn't see it. It was huge.

569
00:20:33,761 --> 00:20:35,631
还记得妈妈座椅倒下去的时候
Remember the look on mom's face

570
00:20:35,662 --> 00:20:37,205
她脸上的表情吗
when her seat fell down?

571
00:20:37,236 --> 00:20:40,434
还有爸爸扑到车头上的时候
How about when dad jumped on the hood of the car?

572
00:20:41,670 --> 00:20:44,154
"你搞什么飞机啊 菲尔"
"What's the plan, Phil?!"

573
00:21:00,554 --> 00:21:03,283
米奇 莉莉
Mitch? Lily?

574
00:21:03,324 --> 00:21:04,785
我们在这儿呢
Hey, we're in here!

575
00:21:05,838 --> 00:21:07,483
小公主在她的城堡里呢
Princess is in her castle!

576
00:21:08,975 --> 00:21:10,875
你们在里面呆多久了
How long have you guys been out here?

577
00:21:10,906 --> 00:21:12,919
小卡 她就是玩不够
Ohh. Cam, she can't get enough.

578
00:21:12,950 --> 00:21:14,881
我们在里面呆了两个小时了
We've been in here for like two hours.

579
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:19,602
这可是咱俩为她而建的
And we did this for her.

580
00:21:20,961 --> 00:21:22,014
要我把你弄出来吗
Need me to get you out of there?

581
00:21:22,014 --> 00:21:23,127
这东西太不安全了 小卡
This thing is not safe, Cam.

582
00:21:23,127 --> 00:21:24,200
到城堡后面去
Move to the back of the castle.

583
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:25,580
我知道怎么做
Yeah, no. I know the drill.

584
00:21:25,621 --> 00:21:27,358
这次别再把我扛出来了
No, don't carry me out this time.

585
00:21:27,389 --> 00:21:29,831
我想这会让莉莉误会
I think it sends the wrong message to Lily.

586
00:21:30,424 --> 00:21:32,150
邻居们围观得可高兴了
Well, the neighbors enjoy it.
